   "answer": "{\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"lines\": [\n        \"We had planned the walk around the tide tables, as everyone must here.\",\n        \"The causeway to the island\",\n        \"is open for a few hours either side of low water, and an early start means the difference between a\",\n        \"dry crossing and a long wait with a flask of tea.\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}",
